        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 62 for SLE 12 SP5)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 4.12.14-122_234 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2022-49053: scsi: target: tcmu: Fix possible page UAF (bsc#1237930).\n- CVE-2025-38000: sch_hfsc: Fix qlen accounting bug when using peek in hfsc_enqueue() (bsc#1245775).\n- CVE-2025-38212: ipc: fix to protect IPCS lookups using RCU (bsc#1246030).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
